   "id": 616980,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "During the Iran-Contra scandal, the “diversion,” according to Oliver North, referred to",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1175144,
     "content_html": "the use of profits from arms sales to Iran to support the Contras"
    },
    {
     "id": 1175143,
     "content_html": "the Reagan administration’s effort to divert attention away from its secret arms deal"
    },
    {
     "id": 1175142,
     "content_html": "the transfer of weapons to Iran"
    },
    {
     "id": 1175141,
     "content_html": "the shift in responsibility for aiding the Contras from the CIA to the NSC"
    }
   ],
